      }
    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "Some Digimon cards can digivolve onto Tamers. Digivolve such a Digimon onto this card, and it will become part of that Digimon’s digivolution cards, allowing you to activate this card’s inherited effect.",
        "question": "How do I activate this card’s inherited effect?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes. The card text reads, “you may,” so you can choose to only place 5 cards with [Hybrid] in their traits under this Tamer without digivolving.",
        "question": "Can I activate this card's [Main] effect to place 5 cards with [Hybrid] in their traits under this Tamer from my trash, and then choose not to digivolve into [EmperorGreymon]?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, you can’t.",
        "question": "If I only have 4 cards in my trash with [Hybrid] in their traits, can I activate this card's [Main] effect to place 4 cards from my trash under this Tamer without digivolving?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, you can’t.",
        "question": "Can I digivolve this Tamer to a [EmperorGreymon] in my hand when an effect to digivolve one of my Digimon other than this card's is activated?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "It can be activated after the tamer has evolved into a Digimon card that can digivolved from the tamer and this card is the digivolution card from the tamer to the digivolved Digimon.",
        "question": "This card has a digivolution card effect, how can I activate it?",
        "reference": "[2]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, it is \"can digivolve\", so it is possible to put 5 cards with \"Hybrid Body\" in the trait from the trash under this tamer without digivolving to \"EmperorGreymon\".",
        "question": "Can I use this card's [Main] effect to put 5 cards with \"Hybrid Body\" in their traits from my trash under this tamer and dare not digivolve to \"EmperorGreymon\"?",
        "reference": "[2]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, I cannot.",
        "question": "When there are only 4 cards with \"Hybrid Body\" in the trait in my trash, can I use this card's [Main] effect to put only 4 cards from my trash under this tamer, even though it cannot digivolution?",
        "reference": "[2]"
      }
    ]
  },
